    "font size" : 10.45,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "二、仪表板安装结构 近年来，越来越多的新能源汽车尝试采用悬浮式仪表板，这种仪表板独立于中控台之上,"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 4,
    "page number" : 93,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 668.3, 294.73, 678.75 ],
    "font" : "SimSun",
    "font size" : 10.45,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "像是悬浮在空中的仪表板，如图 3-12 所示。"
  }, {
    "type" : "image",
    "pdfua_tag" : "Figure",
    "id" : 5,
    "page number" : 93,
    "bounding box" : [ 160.8, 527.02, 434.64, 656.38 ],
    "alt_source" : "missing",
    "source" : "《新能源汽车电气技术》打印(3)_images/imageFile1.png"
  }, {
    "type" : "caption",
    "pdfua_tag" : "Caption",
    "id" : 6,
